OL,3,GNEWSAThousands expected for 40th Derry
OL,4,AHalloween festival finale
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,7,Fexpected in Londonderry for the grand
OL,8,Ffinale of the city's 40th anniversary
OL,9,FHalloween festival, culminating in a
OL,10,Fcarnival parade and fireworks display.
OL,12,FOrganisers say the event has gone from
OL,13,Fhumble beginnings during the Northern
OL,14,FIreland Troubles in the 1980s to
OL,15,FEurope's largest Halloween festival.
OL,17,FThis year, Derry celebrates four
OL,18,Fdecades of the festival with events
OL,19,Finspired by folklore, mythology and the
OL,20,Ftraditions of Samhain, the ancient
OL,21,Ffestival in which Halloween's roots
OL,22,Flie.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
