OL,3,GNEWSAThousands expected for 40th Derry
OL,4,AHalloween festival finale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four-day festival now attracts
OL,7,Fvisitors from all over the world and is
OL,8,Fsaid to generate millions of pounds for
OL,9,Fthe local economy.
